{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212360","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121236001:0":{"text":"그 아이가 도망쳤어! 기가 막혀서 원... 몸도 성치 않은데, 그렇게나 빨리 달리다니!","source_cn":"那姑娘跑了！气死我了……伤成那样，跑得比谁都快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF288030A2ED6AA5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121236002:0":{"text":"도망쳤다고요? 왜... 아직도 저희를 믿지 않는 걸까요?","source_cn":"跑了？怎么会……她还是不愿意相信我们吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C02522C11B72250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121236003:1":{"text":"라이카, 그 아이의 신뢰를 얻는 게 그리 쉽지는 않을 것 같구나.","source_cn":"莱卡，想赢得她的信任，没那么容易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCA7A2AC3EC5C6BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121236004:0":{"text":"오랫동안 블랙골드 상회의 손에 길러졌으니, 시간이 더 필요할 거야.","source_cn":"她被黑金商会养了那么久，我们需要多给她一点耐心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51EDD21720E575A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121236005:0":{"text":"다프니 할머니! 알파 일레븐이 환영의 미궁 쪽으로 가는 걸 누가 봤대요!","source_cn":"达赫妮婆婆！有人看见她往诡幻迷宫的方向去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB4D30FA5C68FD2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121236006:0":{"text":"어서 그 아이를 데리고 오거라! 약초를 두고 가면 그 아이가 돌아왔을 때 바로 먹일 수 있도록 준비해 두마!","source_cn":"快去把她追回来！药草留下，等她回来了立马给我喝干净！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3454DE79751078B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121236007:0":{"text":"알겠어!","source_cn":"知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20F0387DF9E563F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:达赫妮":{"text":"다프니","source":"达赫妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"레미아","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}